{"id":"coque","lemma":"coque","pos":"noun","rank":4456,"glosses":["shell (of an animal's egg)","the casing of a phone","hull"],"ipa":"/kɔk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4b/Fr-coque.ogg/Fr-coque.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"coques"},"formAudio":{"coques":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-coques.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La coque du navire est endommagée.","en":"The ship's hull is damaged.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Il n'y a aucun signe de dommage sur la coque.","en":"There's no sign of damage to the hull.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"none, no-one"},{"g":"sign (indicator"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"c'est dommage = what a…"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"C'est galère d'enlever les coques des châtaignes.","en":"It's a hassle to take the husks off of chestnuts.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"galley"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to remove"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"chestnut","l":"châtaigne"}]},{"text":"Les noix de coco ont une coque dure.","en":"Coconuts have hard shells.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to last","l":"durer"}],"phrases":[[1,4,"coconut"]]},{"text":"Je mange un œuf coque chaque matin au petit déjeuner.","en":"I have a boiled egg for breakfast every day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"egg"},null,{"g":"each"},{"g":"morning"},{"g":"to the"},null,null],"phrases":[[8,10,"breakfast"]]}]}